Since the beginning of the War of Wheels, the emperor's ambitions have been brutally thwarted by the ferocious Barbarians; these tribes wreak havoc with their fighting vehicles, lethal machines assembled from crude but very tough materials. No army dares face them without fearing a bloody end!


 The Barbarians are the fiercest riders in all of Zeranthia.

Gameplay

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44485712/60a92c7e744df138bfb9050dec25d0e78ae8d145.gif

Charge head-on at opponents thanks to its enormous offensive strength and high endurance; 
look for a balance in the clash between health surrendered/offensive bonus.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44485712/2b063c45645bae414ffcbafb4481f178bb0a733b.gif

This imposing vehicle is ideal for riders who have no fear of taking damage and prefer close combat.

The use of Aether has endowed it with the following abilities:
[olist]
 Winter Howl: the vehicle emits a shockwave that stuns opponents for a matter of seconds;
 Bloody Delirium: when its integrity falls below a certain threshold, the damage inflicted by it increases dramatically.
[/olist]

In brief:

 Purely offensive and highly resistant vehicle;
 High damage at close range;
 active skill: stun shockwave;
 passive skill: increased damage inflicted when its health is reduced.


Weapons

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44485712/164683c9b1420a8883aa9096900a60a965e47e5d.png

Barbarian tribesmen boast an arsenal of purely melee weapons, ideal for a closer approach to confrontations;
can mount 3 weapons: a frontal weapon, a pair of side weapons and a ranged weapon located on top of the vehicle; it can choose from 2 different weapon sets:

Set 1

 Battleaxe: slow but enormously lethal frontal weapon;
 Berserker axes: side weapons that quickly wear down enemy vehicles;
 Catapult: slow-moving ranged weapon; its blows unleash dazzling shockwaves.

Set 2

 Falcatas: not as deadly as the battleaxe, but strikes with greater speed;
 Spiked clubs: side weapons that are slow but have high destructive power;
 Recurve bow: not overly damaging, but extremely fast and accurate.


in brief:

 Quick weapons useful for wearing down the integrity of enemy vehicles;
 Extremely lethal slow weapons, annihilating the opponent quickly.


Face the most brutal and bloodthirsty warriors of Zeranthia if you are fearless enough...in the future you too can wreak havoc with such machines of destruction!
